<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
    <Worksheet ss:Name="Dia">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_murray1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">所以，你来嘲笑我的窝…[P=1.5]啊，别介意，我以为你是其他人。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Monkey Island</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">So, you have returned to mock me once mo...[P=1.5] Oh, nevermind, I thought you were somebody else.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_murray2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我刚和你说过，千万不要花超过20块钱来玩一款游戏。啥？你说你玩的是[P=1]…&#10;好吧，当我没说。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Monkey Island</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I've got just one thing to say to you:[P=1] Never pay more than 20 bucks for a computer game.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">好极了，你在#Location_MI;干得非常好！&#10;我们要找的人住在沼泽那头。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Excellent, you did very well in #Location_MI;! The Count I spoke of lives on the other side of this swamp.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">穿越沼泽吧，但要保护好自己哦！&#10;这个沼泽曾经发生过一场大战。&#10;现在#Boss_n07;的仆人在召唤不死物扰乱大地。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Be on your guard though, this swamp was once host to a great battle -- and now #Boss_n07;'s diciples stir the lands, raising undead minions.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_monastery</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">前面就是那个人统治的村子…&#10;呃好吧其实那个人是位伯爵。&#10;告诉他现在世界正面临极大的危险，[P=1.5]&#10;他肯定会送你去见#Boss_n14;的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Up ahead is the Count's village... Convince him that the world is in peril and he will surely send you to #Boss_n14;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_village_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">伯爵很看重他村子里的人，&#10;如果你获得村民的尊重，&#10;也就获得了伯爵的信任！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The Count will only speak to the people of his village. Gain the trust of his villagers and you shall gain the trust of the Count!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_village_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你必须要让伯爵相信，世界正面临着浩劫。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You must convince the Count that the world is in great peril.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_village1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">村子里的人们都很虚弱，如果你帮他们疗伤，[p=1.5]&#10;他们也许会帮你安排与伯爵的会面。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The people of this village are very sick. If you help them, they may help you arrange a meeting with the Count.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_village2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">同一家乡，同一梦想！拯救世界就从拯救村庄开始！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Heroes reference "Save the cheerleader -- save the world"</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Save the village -- save the world.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_Fail1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">村民被杀死了，你便得不到他们的信任…&#10;重新来过吧，我送你回去。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You will never be able to gain the trust of the village by killing the villagers! The only logical thing to do now is to just turn back time a couple of minutes, before you came here and destroyed this lovely village.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_Fail2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是拯救不是摧毁！瞧你干的好事。&#10;我必须把你送回去再来过。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Saving the village -- you're doing it wrong. I must once again send you back in time.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_castle1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">前面就是伯爵的房间，但是，我不能再往前走了，&#10;因为…呃，不说这些，&#10;那不重要，重要的是—</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Up ahead is the Count's chamber. However, I cannot follow you any further due to… Well, never mind all that. That's not important, what's important is this:</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_fvlad_castle2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">伯爵不喜欢外来访客，而且容易发怒。&#10;但是你只要说明你的处境…呃，他一定会理解的！[P=1.5]&#10;祝你“好运”！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The count is not very fond of outsiders, and is quick to anger. But if you just explain the situation to him he will surely see reason.[P=1] Good "luck"!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_kindly</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">喂，我可没什么闲心带你本村一日游！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Hey you! We don't take kindly to your types around here!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_kindly_pos1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我终于可以再跳舞了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I can finally dance again!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_kindly_pos2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">呃，我感觉现在跳也许不太合适。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I just don't feel like doing it right now.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_greatlord1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们的主人伯爵大人是一位伟大的魔导师，&#10;但很显然他没有帮我们解决民生疾苦。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Our lord is a great sorcerer, but apparently there's nothing he can do for us.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_greatlord2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">主人不肯帮我们，亏我们为他勤勤恳恳干了这么多年，&#10;他真抠门！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's a real shame!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_greatlord_pos</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们的主人伯爵大人骗了我们！&#10;你看你这样轻松就医好了我们的疾病，说明只要想治，就有办法！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">the villagers don't think highly of wizards. If *you* can cure us, anyone can!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Our lord tricked us! If you can cure our illness, surely anyone can!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_healthy</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们都这么的虚弱…&#10;[P=1]有时候我希望有一种咒语能还人们健康。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We are all so ill...[P=1]    ...Sometimes I wish there was a spell to make people healthy.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_healthy_pos</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">什么？真有可以让人健康的咒语？！&#10;太感谢了！！！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What? There's a spell to make people healthy?! Thank you!!!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_crops1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">成长吧，庄稼…[P=1]…成长！&#10;我只是心里念而已，才没有动手去揠苗助长呢！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Grow, crops...[P=1]    ...grow!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_crops2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">为什么它们不长高呢？这是为什么呢？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Why won't they grow?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_crops_pos1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你能把我的庄稼也治治好吗…？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Can you heal my crops too...?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_crops_pos2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">…不？&#10;这太糟糕了……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">...No? That's too bad...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_bynow</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们中很多人已经死了……[P=1]&#10;但我很感激，如果不是因为伟大的主人，我们早都死光了。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">minor revision</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">So many of us have died already...[P=1] I am so thankful. If it weren't for our great Lord, we'd all be dead by now.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_bynow_pos</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哦！但若不是为了主人守护村子，&#10;也许所有人都可以离开，都还能活着！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">If it weren't for our Lord, we'd all still be alive!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_dirtywizard1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">拿开你的脏手，我对巫师过敏！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Planet of the apes ref.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Get your hands of me you damn dirty wizard!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_dirtywizard2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">一边玩儿蛋去！别打扰我们。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Go away, you're nothing but trouble!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_dirtywizard3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你的浴袍多久没洗了？比我的香港脚还难闻！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Your bathrobe smells worse than my feet, and I've got gangrene!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_dirtywizard_pos</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">请别在意我说过的蠢话…我，我不是故意的。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm sorry for all those stupid things I said. I didn't even mean some of it.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_mob_intro</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们被“主人”欺骗了！伙儿快拿上杠杠叉叉，&#10;现在是愤怒的小农起义时刻！！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Our "Lord" has deceived us, get your pitchforks! It's angry mob time!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_mob_coward</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">开门！你个芝麻！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Open the gates, you coward!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_mob_regret1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">耶？[P=1]这有点出乎意料…[P=0.5]呃，门居然真的…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">...This was unexpected...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_mob_regret2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">仔细想想看…[P=1]&#10;…我可不想害了性命，万一是误解呢。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Come to think of it...[P=1]    ...I'd rather not go wasting my life over a petty misunderstanding.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是你？你怎么跟着我来了这儿？！&#10;拯救世界的活儿不够你忙的吗？&#10;你就这么闲的蛋疼，[P=1]疼的不行…？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">a new sentence was added at the beginning.  vlad has now been found out: this is his wretched home. And now he is mad at the players.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You? You followed me here?! You just had to go poking your nose in, didn't you...?[P=1] You couldn't be content with just saving the world!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哦我知道了，你一定是对我这座蜗居城堡幸灾&#10;乐祸来的…现在地皮那么贵…泥马不像个傻子一样&#10;盖在沼泽上，我能盖哪儿去呀！&#10;你来给我一块地？你有吗?有木有！…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">No, you had to come here to gloat over this embarrassment of a castle... They told me I was a fool to build it in a swamp...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">现在外面那群村汉民妇都在反抗我了…[P=1]&#10;都是你！你让我别无选择！我要代表月亮消灭你！&#10;这样就没有人会知道…[P=1]我拥有一坨简直让人羞射死&#10;了的蜗居，而且还是座城堡！！！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">and it seems that they were right...[P=1]  ...But no one will ever hear of this shameful fate that has befallen me. You leave me no choice! I must now destroy you!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">但是在你死之前，我会告诉你一个秘密…&#10;也许令人无法置信，&#10;不过我要彻底动摇你对现实的看法……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">But before you die, I will tell you a secret... Something so unbelievable that your entire grasp on reality will be forever shattered....</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro5</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我[P=1]其实[P=1]是一个……[P=1]&#10;……吸血鬼！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I [P=1]am....[P=1]    ...a Vampire!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I [P=1]am....[P=1]    ...a Vampire!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_intro6</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看招！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Have at you!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_battle1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你离死不远了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Death awaits you!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#SW_Text_vlad_battle2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
